+.SS "Informative output:"
+.TP
+\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
+Print this message.
+.TP
+\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
+Print the gperf version number.
+.TP
+\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR
+Enables the debugging option (produces verbose
+output to the standard error).
