+/* This may look like C code, but it is really -*- C++ -*- */
+
+/* Search algorithm.
+
+   Copyright (C) 1989-1998, 2000, 2002 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+   Written by Douglas C. Schmidt <schmidt@ics.uci.edu>
+   and Bruno Haible <bruno@clisp.org>.
